is the banking system.

00:42:42.960 --> 00:42:47.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
When he canceled that
they realized, we're done.

00:42:47.398 --> 00:42:50.868
If he doesn't, if he
stays in and they,

00:42:50.868 --> 00:42:52.803
they had to destroy him.

00:42:54.305 --> 00:42:56.740
I don't know because he, I
think he kicks down walls.

00:42:56.740 --> 00:43:00.077
He's got a good gut on him
and he kicks down walls.

00:43:00.077 --> 00:43:02.446 align:start size:88% position:13%
Not necessarily knowing
what's behind it,

00:43:02.446 --> 00:43:04.715
but that's not good over there.

00:43:04.715 --> 00:43:07.818
My gut tells me these people
over here are doing no good.

00:43:12.156 --> 00:43:15.392 align:start size:97% position:3%
If he knows and he's willing
to stand up against it,

00:43:15.392 --> 00:43:16.694
which I think he would be,

00:43:17.861 --> 00:43:20.698
he would be very,
very, very good.

00:43:20.698 --> 00:43:25.235 align:start position:0%
I'm not sure he fully
understands what he exposed yet.

00:43:27.237 --> 00:43:29.073 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Even after your
recent sitdown with him,

00:43:29.073 --> 00:43:31.609
do you think he didn't get it?

00:43:31.609 --> 00:43:33.777
And not that you fully well
went into all of this, but.

00:43:33.777 --> 00:43:36.146 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I said to him
and I've asked him,

00:43:36.146 --> 00:43:37.715
'cause I just talked
to him again on Friday.

00:43:37.715 --> 00:43:40.150 align:start size:81% position:19%
And I asked him
the same question,

00:43:40.150 --> 00:43:45.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mr. President, you have
to clear out every agency,

00:43:46.123 --> 00:43:49.493
you've gotta fire all of them.

00:43:49.493 --> 00:43:52.596
And he said, I know.

00:43:52.596 --> 00:43:55.366
One thing he said was I,

00:43:57.568 --> 00:44:00.704
I can't do it with
the GOP that I have

00:44:00.704 --> 00:44:04.541 align:start size:97% position:3%
because it will take an
act of Congress and Senate.

00:44:04.541 --> 00:44:06.310
He can't do it with
Mitch McConnell.

00:44:06.310 --> 00:44:07.611
They just won't do it.

00:44:10.114 --> 00:44:12.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
He needs help in Congress
and in the Senate

00:44:12.583 --> 00:44:17.588
to be able to clean
out the viper's nest.

00:44:18.789 --> 00:44:20.057
I had a Congressman
who's very low key.

00:44:20.057 --> 00:44:22.960
Makes Mike Lee look a
little hyper at times,

00:44:24.428 --> 00:44:29.133
who said to me on Friday,
Glenn the FBI is the KGB.

00:44:30.334 --> 00:44:32.403
And I'm like, I'm
sorry, excuse me.

00:44:32.403 --> 00:44:33.637
And he said,

00:44:33.637 --> 00:44:36.106 align:start size:88% position:13%
it is the KGB and we all
in Washington know it

00:44:36.106 --> 00:44:39.009
and no one's doing
anything about it.

00:44:39.009 --> 00:44:40.844
And they have to be cleaned out.

00:44:41.945 --> 00:44:44.682
Trump, I asked this Friday,

00:44:45.883 --> 00:44:49.186
are you working with
a council of people?

00:44:49.186 --> 00:44:52.423
Are you doing anything
to draw up a naughty

00:44:52.423 --> 00:44:54.825
and nice list and figure out

00:44:54.825 --> 00:44:57.561 align:start size:97% position:3%
what you're gonna do, 'cause
you only have four years

00:44:57.561 --> 00:45:01.432
if you run and win, four
years, that's not enough.

00:45:01.432 --> 00:45:06.303
And this is gonna be, this will
be a death match to do this.

00:45:06.303 --> 00:45:09.173
I think he's the
only guy who would,

00:45:09.173 --> 00:45:14.178 align:start size:97% position:3%
but I don't know if he
will or understands it yet.

00:45:15.879 --> 00:45:17.948
- Glenn, I have only one
more question for you,

00:45:17.948 --> 00:45:21.752
which is fairly obvious
after this conversation,

00:45:21.752 --> 00:45:24.922
can I come to this
special unknown place

00:45:24.922 --> 00:45:27.491
and have a small parcel of land?

00:45:27.491 --> 00:45:29.426
Listen, you know,
I had chickens.

00:45:29.426 --> 00:45:31.829
I know how to, I know how
to deal with the coup.

00:45:31.829 --> 00:45:33.330
I know how to clean.

00:45:33.330 --> 00:45:35.365
I've gotten pretty good at
a couple other handy things

00:45:35.365 --> 00:45:36.366
in a new house here.

00:45:36.366 --> 00:45:37.568
And I, you know,

00:45:37.568 --> 00:45:39.336 align:start size:84% position:16%
and I'm pretty decent
for conversation.

00:45:39.336 --> 00:45:41.004
- As long as you just make sure

00:45:41.004 --> 00:45:46.009
you always say I'm from
Florida you can come.

00:45:47.077 --> 00:45:48.345 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I'm gonna literally
have to erase

00:45:48.345 --> 00:45:50.614
the first 35 years of
my life, that's fine.

00:45:50.614 --> 00:45:51.548 align:start size:81% position:19%
- I've never lived
to California,

00:45:51.548 --> 00:45:52.449
what are you talking about?

00:45:52.449 --> 00:45:53.951
- Please.

00:45:53.951 --> 00:45:55.619
- It's another Dave Rubin
who looks just like me.

00:45:57.221 --> 00:45:58.756
- Glenn, it's always an honor

00:45:58.756 --> 00:46:00.691
talking to you and I'm glad
to be in the fight with you

00:46:00.691 --> 00:46:03.360
and hope to see you in
the free state of Texas

00:46:03.360 --> 00:46:04.795
or in the free state of Florida.

00:46:04.795 --> 00:46:06.497 align:start size:97% position:3%
- I think I'm coming to
Florida in a couple of weeks,

00:46:06.497 --> 00:46:07.965
so I'll have to see you then.

00:46:08.866 --> 00:46:10.167
- We'll fire up the grill.

00:46:10.167 --> 00:46:11.001
See you soon.

